; Called from: UT_SAVE, UT_LOAD, ASK_DO, ASK_ADDR, ASK_AD, CLRDIS, SHOW_ADDR, MON_EXAM, MON_FWD, MON_BACK, MON_CC, UT_SETTIME, UT_SETDATE, UT_SHOWDATE, UT_SHOWTIME
;---------------------------------------------------------------
REDIS:       STX   XSAVE
             LDX   #$C16F
             STX   DIGADD
             LDX   XSAVE
             RTS   

